{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1129428-scion-at-gen-con-50","id":1129428,"title":"Scion at Gen Con 50!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-15T14:21:41-07:00","id":1129428,"title":"Scion at Gen Con 50!","content":"Hullo, folks. Here's what we'll be up to with <i>Scion</i> at Gen Con.<br /> <br /> <b>Panel</b><br /> <br /> On Saturday, at 11 AM, at the Crowne Plaza hotel, in Pennsylvania Station B, we'll be hosting a panel for <i>Scion</i> and <i>Trinity</i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Booth</b><br /> <br /> Developer Neall, art director Mike, and other members of the <i>Scion</i> team will be at the Onyx Path booth (#501) to answer questions and talk gaming.<br /> <br /> Our booth crew will be running <i>Scion</i> demos throughout the show. Stop by and play!<br /> <br /> We'll also have some exciting previews from the manuscripts for <i>Origin</i> and <i>Hero</i> for you to flip through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 08-15-2017, 05:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key"